			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000001"]
			description: ["Use a pickaxe on the Cutting Board to cob mined coal measures, copper sulfide, quartz vein, or calcite. Cobbing sacrifices bulk yield for one useful chemical side product."]
